--
-- Test Description
-- Check PTP event frame timer values when a variety of PTP frames are detected
--
--
-- Receive frames:-
-- RX Frame 1 : PTP sync frame
-- RX Frame 2 : PTP delay request frame
-- RX Frame 3 : PTP sync frame but DA address with LSB zero - not recognized
-- RX Frame 4 : PTP pdelay_req frame
-- RX Frame 5 : PTP pdelay_resp frame
-- RX Frame 6 : PTP sync frame  DA address with LSBs 4 - not recognized
-- RX Frame 7 : PTP sync frame  DA address with LSBs 5 - not recognized
--
-- Transmit frames:-
-- TX Frame 1 : PTP sync frame
-- TX Frame 2 : PTP delay request frame
-- TX Frame 3 : PTP pdelay_req frame 
-- TX Frame 4 : PTP pdelay_resp frame 
-- TX Frame 5 : PTP sync frame event with incorrect address
--
--
